---
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-theme="dark">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Zeta — 终端编码代理</title>
	<meta name="description" content="Zeta 是运行在终端里的编码代理：子代理、计划模式、LSP、DAP、事后记忆、hashline 编辑、时间旅行规则——由原生 Rust 引擎驱动。OMP 兼容发行版。">
	<meta property="og:site_name" content="Zeta">
	<meta property="og:type" content="website">
	<meta property="og:title" content="Zeta — 终端编码代理">
	<meta property="og:description" content="子代理、计划模式、LSP、DAP、事后记忆、hashline 编辑、时间旅行规则——原生 Rust 引擎驱动。OMP 兼容发行版。">
	<meta property="og:url" content="https://linxira-os.github.io/zeta/">
	<meta name="theme-color" content="#0E1417" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
	<meta name="theme-color" content="#E8F7F6" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
	<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' fill='%2320B8B0'/%3E%3Ctext x='16' y='24' font-family='Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='%230E1417' text-anchor='middle'%3EZ%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
	<script is:inline>
		const saved = localStorage.getItem('zeta-theme');
		const prefers = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches ? 'light' : 'dark';
		document.documentElement.dataset.theme = saved ?? prefers;
	</script>
	<style>
		:root {
			--teal: #20B8B0;
			--coral: #F36F5D;
			--bg: #0E1417;
			--ink: #E8F7F6;
			--muted: #94a3b8;
			--faint: #64748b;
			--line: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.5);
			--panel: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
			--panel-solid: #131b2e;
			--font: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, "Inter", "Noto Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
			--mono: "SF Mono", "Cascadia Mono", "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
		}
		[data-theme="light"] {
			--bg: #E8F7F6;
			--ink: #0E1417;
			--muted: #475569;
			--faint: #64748b;
			--line: rgba(14, 20, 23, 0.18);
			--panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
			--panel-solid: #ffffff;
		}
		* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
		html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		body {
			font-family: var(--font);
			background: var(--bg);
			color: var(--ink);
			line-height: 1.5;
			font-size: 16px;
			transition: background .2s, color .2s;
		}
		::selection { background: var(--teal); color: var(--bg); }

		.gridlines {
			position: fixed;
			inset: 0;
			pointer-events: none;
			z-index: 0;
			background-image:
				linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px),
				linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px);
			background-size: 60px 60px;
			opacity: .35;
		}
		.container { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5vw; }

		.topbar {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 1.1rem 5vw;
			border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
			position: sticky; top: 0;
			background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent);
			backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
			z-index: 10;
		}
		.wordmark {
			font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .08em;
			text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem;
		}
		.wordmark .zmark {
			display: inline-flex; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
			background: var(--teal); color: var(--bg); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800;
		}
		.nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: .8rem; margin-left: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
		.nav a:hover { color: var(--teal); }
		.theme-toggle {
			background: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink);
			font-family: var(--font); font-size: .75rem; padding: .4rem .8rem;
			cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
		}
		.theme-toggle:hover { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }

		.hero { padding: 7rem 0 4.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
		.hero::before {
			content: ''; position: absolute; top: -45%; left: -15%; width: 65vw; height: 65vw;
			background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(32,184,176,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none;
		}
		.hero::after {
			content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -35%; right: -12%; width: 55vw; height: 55vw;
			background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(243,111,93,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none;
		}
		.hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
		.kicker {
			display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;
			color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .24em;
			font-size: .72rem; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}
		.kicker::before { content: ''; width: 2.4rem; height: 2px; background: var(--teal); }
		.hero h1 {
			font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 6.2rem);
			font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.02;
			margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 18ch;
		}
		.hero h1 .accent {
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--teal), var(--coral));
			-webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
		}
		.hero .lede { max-width: 58ch; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem); color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2.8rem; font-weight: 300; }
		.hero .lede strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

		.cta-row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
		.cta {
			display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2.2rem; text-decoration: none;
			font-weight: 600; font-size: .95rem; letter-spacing: .04em;
			border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink);
			transition: background .15s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
		}
		.cta.primary {
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--teal), var(--coral));
			border-color: transparent; color: #fff;
		}
		.cta.primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
		.cta.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }

		.install { margin-top: 3.2rem; max-width: 720px; }
		.tabs { display: flex; gap: .25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 0; }
		.tab {
			background: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: none;
			color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font); font-size: .75rem;
			letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: .6rem 1.2rem;
			cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: -1px;
		}
		.tab.active { background: var(--panel-solid); color: var(--teal); border-color: var(--line); }
		.tab:not(.active):hover { color: var(--ink); }
		.code {
			background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: none;
			padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .88rem;
			display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
		}
		.code .cmd { white-space: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; }
		.code .prompt { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; margin-right: .6rem; }
		.copy { background: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font); font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: .4rem .7rem; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; }
		.copy:hover { color: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }

		section.block { padding: 5.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
		.section-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 5rem 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3.2rem; align-items: baseline; }
		.section-head .num { color: var(--coral); font-weight: 800; font-size: .95rem; letter-spacing: .1em; }
		.section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
		.section-head .sub { color: var(--faint); font-size: .92rem; margin-top: .4rem; max-width: 60ch; }

		.grid-table { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
		.grid-item { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.6rem; transition: background .15s; position: relative; }
		.grid-item:hover { background: var(--panel); }
		.grid-item .idx { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .18em; }
		.grid-item h3 { font-size: 1.02rem; margin: .8rem 0 .5rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; }
		.grid-item h3 .k { color: var(--coral); font-weight: 800; }
		.grid-item p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; line-height: 1.55; }

		.providers { margin-top: 1rem; }
		.providers .tag-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
		.tag {
			font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .04em; padding: .4rem .8rem;
			border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); background: var(--panel);
		}
		.tag.hot { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }
		.keycap { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: .15rem .5rem; color: var(--ink); background: var(--panel); }

		.modes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
		.mode { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.7rem; }
		.mode .mname { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; }
		.mode .mname .dot { width: .55rem; height: .55rem; background: var(--teal); display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; }
		.mode .mname .dot.alt { background: var(--coral); }
		.mode p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; margin-top: .6rem; line-height: 1.55; }
		.mode code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .8rem; color: var(--teal); background: var(--panel); padding: .1rem .35rem; }

		.didnot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
		.didnot-item { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; }
		.didnot-item .dname { font-weight: 600; font-size: .95rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; }
		.didnot-item .dname::before { content: '—'; color: var(--coral); font-weight: 800; }
		.didnot-item p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; margin-top: .45rem; line-height: 1.5; }

		.sources { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
		.source { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.7rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 160px; transition: background .15s; }
		.source:hover { background: var(--panel); }
		.source .sname { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; }
		.source .sdesc { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; margin-top: .5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
		.source .arrow { color: var(--coral); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; }

		footer { padding: 3rem 5vw; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
		footer .copy { color: var(--faint); font-size: .78rem; }
		footer .foot-links a { color: var(--faint); text-decoration: none; font-size: .78rem; margin-left: 1.2rem; }
		footer .foot-links a:hover { color: var(--teal); }

		@media (max-width: 720px) {
			.topbar { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; }
			.nav a { margin-left: .9rem; font-size: .7rem; }
			.hero { padding-top: 4.5rem; }
			.section-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .4rem; }
			.code { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
			.tab { padding: .5rem .8rem; font-size: .68rem; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="gridlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>

	<header class="topbar">
		<a class="wordmark" href="/zeta/"><span class="zmark">Z</span>ZETA</a>
		<nav class="nav">
			<a href="#features">特性</a>
			<a href="#providers">模型</a>
			<a href="#sessions">会话</a>
			<a href="#modes">模式</a>
			<a href="#ecosystem">生态</a>
		</nav>
		<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" type="button">深浅切换</button>
	</header>

	<main class="container">
		<section class="hero">
			<div class="hero-inner">
				<div class="kicker">终端编码代理 · OMP 兼容发行版</div>
				<h1>编码代理，<br>接入 IDE<span class="accent">。</span></h1>
				<p class="lede">
					<strong>Zeta</strong> 是运行在终端里的编码代理：<strong>子代理</strong>、<strong>计划模式</strong>、
					<strong>LSP</strong>、<strong>DAP</strong>、<strong>事后记忆</strong>、<strong>hashline 编辑</strong>、
					<strong>时间旅行规则</strong>——由原生 Rust 引擎驱动。作为 OMP 的下游发行版，Zeta 保持与 OMP 生态的兼容，
					并持续同步上游演进。
				</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="cta primary" href="#install">开始使用</a>
					<a class="cta ghost" href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-zeta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">文档与源码 →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="install" id="install">
					<div class="tabs">
						<button class="tab active" type="button" data-tab="npm">npm</button>
						<button class="tab" type="button" data-tab="bun">bun</button>
						<button class="tab" type="button" data-tab="curl">curl</button>
					</div>
					<div class="code" data-pane="npm">
						<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span>npm install -g @zeta/pi-coding-agent</span>
						<button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="npm install -g @zeta/pi-coding-agent">复制</button>
					</div>
					<div class="code" data-pane="bun" hidden>
						<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span>bun add -g @zeta/pi-coding-agent</span>
						<button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="bun add -g @zeta/pi-coding-agent">复制</button>
					</div>
					<div class="code" data-pane="curl" hidden>
						<span class="cmd"><span class="prompt">$</span>curl -fsSL https://linxira-os.github.io/install | sh</span>
						<button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://linxira-os.github.io/install | sh">复制</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="block" id="features">
			<div class="section-head">
				<div class="num">01</div>
				<div>
					<h2>把 IDE 接到终端里</h2>
					<div class="sub">OMP 生态的全部核心能力，随发行版同步演进——不是可选的扩展，而是内置的默认。</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="grid-table">
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">01</div><h3><span class="k">S</span>子代理 Subagents</h3><p>将任务拆给并行的子代理，各自携带独立上下文与工具集，在主会话中汇总结果。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">02</div><h3><span class="k">P</span>计划模式 Plan mode</h3><p>先规划、再执行：让代理先产出计划供你审阅，批准后才触碰工作区。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">03</div><h3><span class="k">L</span>LSP 语言服务</h3><p>内置 LSP 客户端：跳转定义、查找引用、诊断与补全，编辑时同步感知代码语义。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">04</div><h3><span class="k">D</span>DAP 调试适配器</h3><p>对接调试适配协议，代理可以设置断点、读取栈帧、检查变量并解释失败原因。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">05</div><h3><span class="k">H</span>事后记忆 Hindsight memory</h3><p>回顾过往会话的成败与教训，在后续任务中自动利用积累的 hindsight 记忆。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">06</div><h3><span class="k">E</span>Hashline 编辑</h3><p>行级精确编辑语义：内容寻址的行编辑，让重构与批量替换保持可追溯。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">07</div><h3><span class="k">T</span>时间旅行规则</h3><p>按时间线生效的项目规则：旧提交的约定不会错误地套用在新代码上。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">08</div><h3><span class="k">R</span>原生 Rust 引擎</h3><p>文本、正则、grep 与 diff 等重活交给 Rust 原语，长文件与大型仓库不拖后腿。</p></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="block" id="providers">
			<div class="section-head">
				<div class="num">02</div>
				<div>
					<h2>15+ 提供商，数百个模型</h2>
					<div class="sub">统一客户端接入主流提供商，API Key 或 OAuth 认证。会话中用 <span class="keycap">/model</span> 或 <span class="keycap">Ctrl+L</span> 随时切换模型。</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="providers">
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag hot">Anthropic</span><span class="tag hot">OpenAI</span><span class="tag hot">Google</span>
					<span class="tag">Azure</span><span class="tag">Bedrock</span><span class="tag">Mistral</span>
					<span class="tag">Groq</span><span class="tag">Cerebras</span><span class="tag">xAI</span>
					<span class="tag">Hugging Face</span><span class="tag">Kimi</span><span class="tag">MiniMax</span>
					<span class="tag">NVIDIA</span><span class="tag">OpenRouter</span><span class="tag">Ollama</span>
					<span class="tag">更多…</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="block" id="sessions">
			<div class="section-head">
				<div class="num">03</div>
				<div>
					<h2>会话是树，不是日志</h2>
					<div class="sub">回到任意历史节点继续，分支与主线共存于同一个文件；导出、分享、加密协同。</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="grid-table">
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">01</div><h3>分支式历史</h3><p>会话按树状结构存储，任意时刻可回退到之前的节点并从中继续。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">02</div><h3>导出与分享</h3><p><code class="keycap">/export</code> 导出 HTML；<code class="keycap">/share</code> 上传为可分享链接，他人可直接打开查看。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">03</div><h3>加密协同</h3><p><code class="keycap">/collab</code> 建立端到端加密的实时会话，参与者渲染同一会话、同一工具卡片。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">04</div><h3>断点续接</h3><p>进程重启后以 <code class="keycap">--continue</code> 回到原会话，保留完整推理与决策轨迹。</p></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="block" id="context">
			<div class="section-head">
				<div class="num">04</div>
				<div>
					<h2>上下文工程</h2>
					<div class="sub">控制进入上下文窗口的内容与方式，而不是让模型自行猜测。</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="grid-table">
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">01</div><h3>AGENTS.md</h3><p>项目指令：启动时从 <code class="keycap">~/.zeta/agent/</code>、父目录与当前目录逐级加载。</p></div>
				<div class="grid-item"><div class="idx">02</div><h3>SYSTEM.md</h3><p>按项目替换或追加默认系统提示词，为每个仓库定制人格与约束。</p></div>
